<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Joan — technical founder working on data and AI products."
	pubDate={new Date('October 19 2023')}
>
	<p>
		I'm a hands-on technical founder with over 10 years in construction technology. I'm fortunate to
		be able to code 80% of my time in any tech stack area: frontend, backend, machine learning,
		quality assurance, mobile, cloud architecture, etc.
	</p>

	<p>
		I studied computer science at university and started SpecifiedBy right after. During my
		entrepreneurship tenure at SpecifiedBy, the client side within the client-server architecture
		became fragmented: web, native, desktop, mobile, devices, wearables, etc.
	</p>

	<p>
		This pushed me to invest my energy into the common denominator amongst the large variety of
		clients: <strong>data</strong>. Most of my career has been about building data and AI first
		products for users.
	</p>

	<p>
		Apart from my professional endeavors, I've actively contributed to the open-source community
		through research papers, code, and insightful talks. These contributions reflect my commitment to
		sharing knowledge and advancing our field.
	</p>
</Layout>
